# qmldir — explicit module manifest for modules/dashboard/ (Phase 14 Plan 03)
#
# Checking this file in disables Quickshell's directory-scanner synthesis for
# this directory (same finding as the parent modules/qmldir header) — any
# .qml type added to this directory that is NOT declared below becomes
# unresolvable to Dashboard.qml's `import "dashboard"`. A type MUST be
# registered in the SAME commit that creates it.
#
# This manifest was owned by plan 14-03 and frozen for wave 3 (14-04..14-07):
# a wave-3 plan needing an unlisted type here found a 14-03 scope
# correction, not a licence to edit this file. Nine types, none a singleton
# — the two shell-root backends and the shared resource reader are mounted
# once as ordinary instances by 14-03 (shell.qml / Dashboard.qml), which
# keeps their lifetime explicit rather than ambient.
#
# Plan 14-09 (phase close) adds a tenth type, registered in the same
# commit that creates it: `Cascade`, D-21's summon-only entrance-cascade
# runner. Also non-visual, also not a singleton — one ordinary instance,
# mounted on Dashboard.qml's window root.
#
# 14-09 also adds an eleventh type and this manifest's FIRST singleton:
# `Design`, the shared spacing/type constants four plans deferred. It
# carries the `singleton` keyword below AND a `pragma Singleton` in its
# source — the 12-06 finding is that BOTH are required, and that omitting
# this keyword yields a type that is never constructed and reads
# `undefined` forever with no load error to warn you.
#
# 14-09 Task 4 (render-gate change request) adds a twelfth type and this
# manifest's SECOND singleton: `WeatherPalette`, a deliberate, documented
# exemption to the repo-wide zero-hex/duration-literal invariant's palette
# contract — see the file's own header for the full rationale (citation
# corrected in 14-10, see that file's own header note). Same both-required
# discipline as `Design` above.
#
# Plan 14-10 Task 1 adds a thirteenth type, not a singleton: `ConditionGlyph`,
# the single-or-layered weather condition glyph the two-tone experiment
# needs. One ordinary instance per call site, exactly like `Dial`.
#
# DASH-10 adds a fourteenth type, not a singleton: `GradientBorder`, the
# animated gradient rim that matches Hyprland's own window border. One
# ordinary instance, mounted on Dashboard.qml's window root beside the
# surface it outlines. Registered in the same commit that creates it, per
# this manifest's own rule above.
#
# Quick task 260823-9ak Task 1 adds a type here, not a singleton:
# `AttachedCorner`, the concave flare joining a panel's vertical side to the
# screen edge it hangs from (R7). One instance per side, sharing this
# directory with GradientBorder because both Dashboard.qml (`import
# "dashboard"`) and Launcher.qml (`import "../dashboard"`) already resolve
# it, so one file serves both consumers with no new import path.
#
# Phase 15 Plan 02 (the phase's tracer, PANEL-06) adds three more types,
# none a singleton, in the SAME commit that creates them, per this
# manifest's own standing rule: `PanelDialog`, the shared standalone-panel
# frame every panel this phase and Phase 16 add is constructed FROM; and
# `AudioPanel`/`AudioBackend`, the audio panel's body and PipeWire adapter.
#
# Phase 15 Plan 03 adds four more, same non-singleton, same-commit rule:
# `WifiPanel`/`WifiBackend`, the wifi panel's body and NetworkManager
# adapter; `BluetoothPanel`/`BluetoothBackend`, the bluetooth panel's body
# and BlueZ adapter — all four instances of PanelDialog's shared frame
# (PANEL-06).
#
# Phase 19 Plan 05 (D-19-19/QNOTIF-07) adds a third singleton: `ToggleState`,
# the sole owner of all six quick-toggle tiles' state, promoted out of
# `QuickToggles.qml` so a second grid instance (Plan 19-06's centre footer)
# cannot drift from the drawer's own. Same both-required `pragma Singleton`
# + qmldir `singleton` keyword discipline as `Design`/`WeatherPalette` above.
#
# Quick task 260818-v3m adds a fifteenth type, not a singleton:
# `GeocodeBackend`, the second fenced host (reverse-geocode, nominatim.
# openstreetmap.org) — one ordinary instance, owned by `WeatherBackend.qml`
# as a plain child, not mounted at shell root (exactly one consumer).
#
# Quick task 260819-6oy adds a sixteenth type, not a singleton:
# `NewsBackend`, the third fenced host in the widened sense its own header
# records (an operator-editable news-sources.json rather than a single
# literal host, enforced instead by a two-point https:// scheme allowlist)
# — one ordinary instance, mounted at shell.qml's root as a sibling of
# WeatherBackend, despite its only consumer being the notification centre's
# News tab (modules/centre/NewsPane.qml): this directory is the repo's
# backend home regardless of consumer, per AudioBackend's own precedent
# (AudioBackend lives here and serves the centre footer, the bar and the
# OSD).
#
# Quick task 260826-rfy adds three types, none a singleton, all in the same
# commit that creates them per this manifest's own standing rule:
# `Sparkline`, the Canvas line-chart primitive; `PerfTelemetry`, the
# Performance tab's "telemetry" layout (plate P3); and `DashLanes`, the
# Dashboard tab's "lanes" layout (plate D2). The two layout types are
# SIBLINGS of `PerformanceTab`/`DashboardTab` rather than replacements —
# Dashboard.qml's two tab Loaders now choose between them on
# `Prefs.getValue("dashboard.layout.*")`, so the pre-existing single-column
# and five-dial layouts stay selectable and stay registered below.
#
# Quick task 260827-50i adds the three layout types 260826-rfy left unbuilt,
# each registered in the SAME commit that creates it per the standing rule
# at the top of this file: `PerfArcs` (plate P2, "arcs"), `DashBento` (plate
# D1, "bento") and `PerfCards` (plate P1, "cards"). None is a singleton, and
# none replaces a sibling — all four Performance layouts and all three
# Dashboard layouts stay selectable through `Prefs.getValue("dashboard.
# layout.*")`.
module qs.modules.dashboard
singleton Design 1.0 Design.qml
singleton WeatherPalette 1.0 WeatherPalette.qml
singleton ToggleState 1.0 ToggleState.qml
DashboardTab 1.0 DashboardTab.qml
MediaTab 1.0 MediaTab.qml
PerformanceTab 1.0 PerformanceTab.qml
WeatherTab 1.0 WeatherTab.qml
MediaBackend 1.0 MediaBackend.qml
WeatherBackend 1.0 WeatherBackend.qml
GeocodeBackend 1.0 GeocodeBackend.qml
NewsBackend 1.0 NewsBackend.qml
SystemResources 1.0 SystemResources.qml
QuickToggles 1.0 QuickToggles.qml
Dial 1.0 Dial.qml
Sparkline 1.0 Sparkline.qml
PerfTelemetry 1.0 PerfTelemetry.qml
DashLanes 1.0 DashLanes.qml
PerfArcs 1.0 PerfArcs.qml
DashBento 1.0 DashBento.qml
PerfCards 1.0 PerfCards.qml
Cascade 1.0 Cascade.qml
ConditionGlyph 1.0 ConditionGlyph.qml
GradientBorder 1.0 GradientBorder.qml
AttachedCorner 1.0 AttachedCorner.qml
PanelDialog 1.0 PanelDialog.qml
AudioPanel 1.0 AudioPanel.qml
AudioBackend 1.0 AudioBackend.qml
WifiPanel 1.0 WifiPanel.qml
WifiBackend 1.0 WifiBackend.qml
BluetoothPanel 1.0 BluetoothPanel.qml
BluetoothBackend 1.0 BluetoothBackend.qml
